    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "part of the business to be successful\nand to manage the people correctly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405760,
    "dDurationMs": 7840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because they're either too soft\nor too egotistical and too hard. You you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411800,
    "dDurationMs": 7119,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't get that right balance with my\nmanagement or very rarely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416160,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um so, that is a quest. It was my\neverlasting quest to get people in a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421120,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fact as part of the you talked about\nvertical integration earlier on. As part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425360,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the horizontal and vertical\nintegration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427400,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e So, so so I I've never heard this\nbefore. I was asking him about",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430880,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "diversification and he said that well, I\ndiversify but in a focused way and I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435000,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "touched on so, you got a vertically\nintegrated business but you said you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437280,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have it's vertical and horizontally\nintegrated. You got to have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439880,
    "dDurationMs": 5039,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Well, let me explain this example\nbecause this this one this one was",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442800,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "crucial to my success.\nWe were having to recruit especially"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447080,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I set up Phones 4 U and we wanted\nhundreds hundreds of sales people for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451200,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the shops.\nSo, I set up my own recruitment company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455000,
    "dDurationMs": 6920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, it's an internal recruitment company\nthat was then to that a vertical"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459360,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "integrate to to all the employees for\nthe whole organization that was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464080,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "recruiting hundreds every month.\nBut then what I started doing was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467960,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "selling those services out to other\npeople."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471040,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that business became a supplier\nto all my businesses and an external"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476080,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "supplier.\nAnd that's what we did with all of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478560,
    "dDurationMs": 8720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So every business I set up was aimed to\nbe a profit center for other people to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483760,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make money externally, but also mainly\nto provide the services internally. And"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489160,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you said that your suppliers though,\nwhen you got so big they became your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491600,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enemy.\n\u003e\u003e They always became the enemy. Yeah, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494480,
    "dDurationMs": 7400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they were utterly ruthless, utterly\nMachiavellian"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499640,
    "dDurationMs": 7279,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and devious. And I can give you an\namazing example of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504200,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh because it was almost life-ending for\nme. I'd got to the point of about 50"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509440,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "employees.\nUm it's quite a big organization by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513320,
    "dDurationMs": 3399,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then. I mean, you know that now from\nyour 60."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515520,
    "dDurationMs": 6280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e did it take you to get to 50?\n\u003e\u003e Uh that took uh 2 years. Mhm. So it took",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519840,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "me 2 years to get to the first 50\nemployees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523159,
    "dDurationMs": 6161,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh we were on target to make a million\npounds profit that year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526960,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on a 13 million turnover.\nAnd my biggest supplier, Motorola,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531760,
    "dDurationMs": 7920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "supplied 95%\nof my sales. Wasn't by choice because I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537720,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have a 10% rule which I'll come back to\nlater, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540920,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it wasn't by choice, it was by necessity\nbecause they had 90 odd percent of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544600,
    "dDurationMs": 9760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "market in the UK and worldwide actually.\nSo they were my main supplier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551480,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really my only critical supplier.\nAnd one day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556120,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the general manager of Motorola came to\nsee me and he said, \"You know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560320,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think there's room for you in\nthis marketplace.\" He said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563680,
    "dDurationMs": 7120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"If anybody was going to be doing what\nyou were doing, I think it would be me.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568360,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I thought from that that Motorola\nmeant that they were going to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572240,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think about taking distribution off me\nand doing it themselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576720,
    "dDurationMs": 8800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, lo and behold, they did cancel\nmy contract. 95% of my business gone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582640,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like that. Bang. Wow. Overnight,\ncuz they stopped my supply."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587680,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um\nif you lose 95% of your business when"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591080,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're only on probably 5% margin,\nyou've got nothing left to pay anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594880,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Doesn't, you know, it's terminal.\nAnyway, uh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598520,
    "dDurationMs": 7160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the second part of that story is that\nhe didn't do it as Motorola. He resigned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604080,
    "dDurationMs": 7640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from Motorola and set up his own\nbusiness with my contract, supply"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608560,
    "dDurationMs": 7720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "contract. So, he became a competitor of\nmine having left Motorola with my"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614080,
    "dDurationMs": 7280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "contract in place.\nAnyway, that was that was really really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619280,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a tough few sleepless nights, but I\nfound a solution because I went to one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624280,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or two of the service providers, which\nwas a model in the UK where service"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628040,
    "dDurationMs": 7080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "providers sold the airtime on behalf of\nthe airtime network providers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633600,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they always got a good deal from\nMotorola on product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636920,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I did a secret deal with them and\nsaid, \"Look, I'll put my volume onto"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640960,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your volume.\" They didn't know I'd been\nsacked by Motorola, by the way. I'll put"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644440,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my volume onto your volume. You'll get\neven bigger discounts. We'll keep it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648240,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "quiet from Motorola. They'll never know.\nAnd you supply me with the equipment.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652280,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they did, and I got even cheaper\nprices. And I bailed myself out of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655880,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trouble within about 2 weeks.\nAnd then I nurtured Nokia,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660160,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who were going to be the new kids on the\nblock,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662440,
    "dDurationMs": 7960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who had got one or two phones coming out\nthere I thought were going to be real"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667080,
    "dDurationMs": 8240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "successful. And I nurtured those people\nto to kill Motorola."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673000,
    "dDurationMs": 10800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we took Nokia's market share after\nthat from 1% to 21% and Motorola started"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680240,
    "dDurationMs": 8280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "diving down. And they, of course,\nreally failed in a big way, not just in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685920,
    "dDurationMs": 8880,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the UK, but worldwide. John, your\nbusiness was losing £2,000 a month when"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692080,
    "dDurationMs": 7280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you first started. And then fast forward\neven later, you had trouble with your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696680,
    "dDurationMs": 8680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your top manufacturer that was supplying\n95% of your business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702960,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did you What was the vision for you\nlike in order to persist through those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707240,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "moments? Like most people, if they\nlooked at you from the outside, they'd"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710840,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be like, \"Your business is losing 2,000\npounds a month. You're crazy.\" What for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715320,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you was the vision in starting that\ncompany and got you through those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719560,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "persistent hard times? Well, the 2,000\nthe 2,000 pounds a month loss, I always"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724880,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "knew mobile phones was going to be big.\nNot like it is. I mean, in those days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728840,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nobody wanted a mobile phone, but I just\nthought I get I went back to my"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732360,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "childhood when nobody had a home\ntelephone. When I was born, nobody had a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736720,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "home telephone. If you had a home\ntelephone, you're extraordinary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741360,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10, 15, 20 years later, when I was in my\nteens, everybody had a home telephone. I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745400,
    "dDurationMs": 6120,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thought, \"Well, why wouldn't you have a\nhand device that could put you in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749960,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "contact?\" I mean, it sounds ridiculous\nsaying this to your audience now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753040,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doesn't it? Well, but\n\u003e\u003e is the '80s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754920,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e But then But then it was visionary,\nreally, because I just thought, \"Well,",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757760,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why wouldn't everybody have a mobile\nphone?\" And they were incredibly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761120,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "expensive.\nSo, I knew I could turn the business"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764000,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into something. I just had to persevere.\nAnd as I say, the luck was when my my"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768480,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "employees all went, I took over the\nmobile phone business personally and saw"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772760,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "arbitrage opportunities where I could\nmake a lot of money. What were those"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776600,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "changes that you made\ninitially when you stepped in? Well, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780120,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first arbitrage opportunity was and\nthere was hundreds over the years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784120,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thousands probably, but the first one\nwas that Motorola sold to the service"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789240,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "providers. They sold to the service\nproviders at a cheaper price than me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794480,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there was a shortage of these\nhandsets. They were the big bag phones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797480,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You won't remember those, but they were\ncalled the Motorola transportable, a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800560,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "great big lump that made one arm longer\nthan the other as you carried it around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804760,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And everybody wanted them and they were\nin short supply."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808760,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So,\nwhat they did, because I was paying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811920,
    "dDurationMs": 7920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about £50 a unit more than the service\nproviders, I could get as many as I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817040,
    "dDurationMs": 7720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wanted. And all they did was stop the\nservice providers supply and sold to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823000,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I went to the service providers and\nsaid, \"Look,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826280,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can supply you the phones. They're\ngoing to be £50 more than you're paying,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830280,
